v0.3.18: logic and cross-platform fixes from code walkthrough

- client keepSession: Object.assign order fixed (cwdArg first, target
  sessionId last) - keep-all on a non-current session no longer silently
  acts on the CURRENT session
- host withinRoot: case-insensitive comparison (canonCwd lowercases the
  drive letter but fs.resolve may return uppercase targetKey; strict
  compare misjudged Windows writes/scans as out-of-bounds)
- host buildEditorCommand: -ArgumentList multi-args comma-separated
  (PowerShell array syntax) instead of space-separated positional params
- client refresh: queued refresh so an operation landing during a 2s poll
  no longer waits for the next cycle to show its result
